{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03893","headline":"拟古 · 崔融","name":"拟古","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"饮马临浊河，浊河深不测。\n河水日东注，河源乃西极。\n思君正如此，谁爲生羽翼。\n日夕大川阴，云霞千里色。\n所思在河处，宛在机中织。\n离梦当有魂，愁容定无力。\n夙龄负奇志，中夜三叹息。\n拔劒斩长榆，弯弓射小棘。\n班张固非拟，衞霍行可即。\n寄谢闺中人，努力加飱食。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03893.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03893","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}